Z||000006||Fierokid87||07-31-2001||11:49 AM||||Ok if you look on the deck lid there are little round raised spots.  there are i think two sets of these.  one is the spoiler the other is the lugage rack.  You look at your wing and see what one is space properly.  then you drill out that hole.  And install the wing into those holes.  Then you mark where the front wing studs sit on the decklid and drill those out.  and then your wing is lined up exactly as it was from the factory.<P>Scott<P>PS  if you need pictures  Ill sent you them.  <P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="BLOODY"> Fierokid's  Web site<BR>http://www.angelfire.com/sports/sfiero<P>AIM: Fierokid87<BR>ICQ: Fierokid</FONT><P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sfiero.JPG"> ||||reg||1
